  "decisiveObservations": [
    "All new keys are recognizably Mourning Dove-like and contain genuine body/wing/feather redraws. They are not the old static neutral shifted or bobbed.",
    "The new bird is visibly larger and puffier, with changed tail/body proportions relative to canonical neutral. Normal-size first and return joins show a distracting size/volume jump in both raw and codec.",
    "Foot image planes shift substantially between the ready/wing-fan and ruffled/settle keys while source root stays fixed. This is source coherence failure, independent of absent pressure/contact approval.",
    "Wing-fan and spiky body-rouse keys are useful studies; a sequence of four static states with labels alone does not establish complete flutter or shake mechanics.",
    "No distracting rectangular/baked background matte was visible at normal light/dark. The63color/alpha derivative slightly flattens fine feather/foot fringes but does not repair scale, volume or stance joins.",
    "No water is baked into bird artwork, which is appropriate to separated effects. Lack of baked water is not the rejection reason. Wet contact, immersion, rim occlusion and full bathing actions remain outside this source-art approval."
  ],
